837	 * container (2026-09-06), not guessed — it builds the launch line with
838	 * `add_argument_pair ARGUMENTS "+server.hostname" "RUST_SERVER_NAME"` and
839	 * friends. `pve` has no env var of its own and goes through
840	 * `RUST_SERVER_STARTUP_ARGUMENTS` instead (see below).
