876	 *  1. **No server.cfg exists.** Rust does not ship one; the image creates
877	 *     `bans.cfg`, `users.cfg`, `serverauto.cfg` and `relay_cfg.json` in
878	 *     `/opt/rust/server/docker/cfg/` and nothing else. `remoteLocate` only ever
879	 *     matches an EXISTING file, so every apply soft-failed with "Could not
