1227	// container restarts for any reason (crash, host reboot, a future settings
1228	// change). It was never live in production (ENABLE_REAL_GAMECFG was off), so
1229	// no customer was ever bitten by it, but turning the flag on without fixing
1230	// this first would have shipped that same bug to everyone.
