1232	// The only durable way to change these settings is to recreate the container
1233	// with updated environment variables. Secrets (ADMIN_PASSWORD, which also
1234	// gates RCON) are written to an --env-file over SFTP and referenced by path —
1235	// never passed as `-e KEY=value` on a command line, where they would sit in
1236	// plaintext in `ps aux`/shell history on the customer's own VM (the same
1237	// hardening already applied by hand to sausaugepro's live fix the same day).
